published without a license. Loam keeps their names, short descriptions,
categories and avatars only for the catalog bundled with this build, links
every entry back to its original x.ai listing, and does not rehost prompts.
Avatars remain the property of their creators. All rights reserved.

BUILD NOTE — internal only
--------------------------
x.ai marketplace content in this catalog is INTERNAL-ONLY. It was collected
for a personal/internal build (MARKETPLACE_SPEC §5, option (a)) and must NOT
be shipped in any public or redistributed build with the content bundled.
A public distribution must instead follow option (b): ship metadata only
(name, short description, category, links) and fetch the remaining details
at runtime, or ship the botdirectory-only catalog. x.ai prompts are never
stored or rehosted: detail panels link back to the original listing and its
"Add on x.ai" share link, so configurations behind share links stay linked,
never rehosted. Attribution for every x.ai entry (creator + source URL +
"all rights reserved") is rendered in the detail panel's Source section,
and per-entry botdirectory attribution (contributor + source URL + MIT)
is rendered there as well.


